# VS Code REST Client — install 'REST Client' extension then click 'Send Request'

### Get all parts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/parts

###

### Get low stock parts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/parts/low-stock

###

### Get stage summary
GET http://localhost:5000/api/parts/summary

###

### Add a part
POST http://localhost:5000/api/parts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partName": "Test Filter",
  "supplierName": "Bosch",
  "machineModel": "Excavator X200",
  "stage": "SUPPLIER",
  "stockQuantity": 20,
  "unitCost": 100,
  "reorderThreshold": 10,
  "notes": ""
}

###

### Advance part to next stage (replace 1 with real id)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/parts/1/advance

###

### Update stock quantity
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/parts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

###

### Get part history
GET http://localhost:5000/api/parts/1/history

###

### Delete a part
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/parts/1
